  "We deliver freshly prepared cakes, cake jars and bakery items across Dubai. This policy explains where we deliver, minimum order values, charges, scheduling and what happens if a delivery cannot be completed.": "policies:copy_7d0526322223768f",
  "We deliver only within Dubai, to the communities listed below. Each area has a minimum order value (products only). If your area is not listed, please ask us before ordering. We do not take payment for an address outside our delivery area, below its minimum order value, or whose area we cannot confirm.": "policies:copy_bcf68256a9c2bb1f",
