  "We keep order, payment and conversation records only for as long as they are needed for the purposes above, including resolving questions about an order and meeting legal, tax and accounting record-keeping requirements.": "policies:copy_e99ddfe3d670d2ad",
  "We make Tres Leches cakes, cake jars, bakery items and custom cakes. Products are freshly prepared and perishable. Because they are handmade, colours, decoration and finish may vary slightly from photographs, which are for illustration only.": "policies:copy_58c03a867f07440e",
  "We may decline a refund request where:": "policies:copy_1474607feffe38b6",
  "We may decline an order before payment — for example if the delivery address is outside our delivery area, the order is below the area’s minimum value, or a product is unavailable. If, after payment, we cannot fulfil all or part of your order, we will contact you and refund the amount paid for anything we cannot supply.": "policies:copy_c9ed40cc6991c34c",
  "We may update these terms from time to time. The version published on this page when you pay for your order applies to that order.": "policies:copy_0b2bf8e9f5d9e7bf",
  "We may update this policy from time to time. The date at the top of this page shows when it was last updated.": "policies:copy_868854ad99f76ce5",
